#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:279
msgid ""
"WooCommerce pages include: product archives/categories, single product pages "
"and account pages."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce pages include: product archives/categories, single product pages "
"and account pages."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:280
msgid "On all pages where a Tax Switch block/shortcode is placed."
msgstr "On all pages where a Tax Switch block/shortcode is placed."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:281
msgid ""
"Hidden on pages that are not part of the store. Stops rendering completely."
msgstr ""
"Hidden on pages that are not part of the store. Stops rendering completely."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:282
msgid ""
"Hidden on pages that do not display any prices. Renders, but hides the "
"components (slightly slower)."
msgstr ""
"Hidden on pages that do not display any prices. Renders, but hides the "
"components (slightly slower)."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:283
msgid ""
"Tax Switch blocks/shortcodes are always hidden on the cart and checkout "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Tax Switch blocks/shortcodes are always hidden on the cart and checkout "
"pages."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:288
msgid "Price switching in mini cart"
msgstr "Price switching in mini cart"

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:290
msgid ""
"Allow customers to switch between prices including and excluding tax in the "
"default WooCommerce mini cart."
msgstr ""
"Allow customers to switch between prices including and excluding tax in the "
"default WooCommerce mini cart."

#: includes/class-wdevs-tax-switch-woocommerce.php:291
msgid ""
"By default, price switching is disabled in the mini cart to keep cart totals "
"consistent. After changing this setting, empty the mini cart and reload to "
"see the updated behavior (the mini cart markup is cached)."
msgstr ""
"By default, price switching is disabled in the mini cart to keep cart totals "
"consistent. After changing this setting, empty the mini cart and reload to "
"see the updated behavior (the mini cart markup is cached)."

